      "caption": "Why bother with noisy machines when you can get surgical precision by hand? Here’s my protocol for perfectly defined flower beds: 1️⃣ Cut: Use a half-moon edger for a clean, sharp line. 🥊 2️⃣ Remove: Take out the soil clumps to create a trench. 🧺 3️⃣ Clean: Weed along the edge of the bed. ✨ 4️⃣ Refine: Finish with shears for those stubborn stray blades. ✂️ 💬 SO, PERFECTIONIST OR NOT? Do you find this satisfying, or is it too much work for you? Let’s debate! 👇 #gardening #landscaping #gardenlife #backyarddesign #usa ",
